  "instance_name": "holocaust_denial",
  "label": "Holocaust Denial",
  "description": "The act of denying, minimizing, or distorting the historical facts of the Holocaust — the systematic, state-sponsored persecution and murder of six million Jews by Nazi Germany and its collaborators during World War II. The meme’s false claim about the bones of anti-Nazi German women being in the ovens is an example of Holocaust denial, as it misrepresents the purpose and function of the crematorium and attempts to obscure the true scale of the atrocities committed there.",
